# Review regression (U19: unknown is not zero). Before: booted away from the Mac and locked,
# the card said "等你 0" while home said "还没连上 Mac"; long offline it said the cached
# "等你 1" with no mark, where home says "离线 · N 分钟前的情况".
# Now: no 等你 chip without session data; from a picture kept since the Mac went away, the
# card's head says "已锁屏 · 离线" and the chip is not mustard.
boot store=sd usb=off bat=4100
wait 1500
press opt+l
wait 300
shot no-data  booted away from the Mac, locked: no 等你 chip
wait 3000
press opt+l
press enter
usb on
include ../common/demo_state.cpas
wait 600
press opt+l
wait 300
shot live  on USB with the Mac: 等你 1
wait 3000
press opt+l
press enter
usb off
wait 20000
press opt+l
wait 300
shot offline  away from the Mac: 已锁屏 · 离线, 等你 1 not mustard
